<title>SWEDEN: Trading suspended in Foreningsbanken and Swedbank.</title>
<headline>Trading suspended in Foreningsbanken and Swedbank.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm bourse on Monday suspended trading in the shares of banks Foreningsbanken and Swedbank.</p>
<p>The bourse said more information would be released later on Monday or on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
